          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the presence of orange-colored light points in the night sky followed by a rapid disappearance: probable observations of Thai lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "7a4efdbff82155531e7f73a108f828aaf6eff7ba064ac299725581bdd42fbf8c"
